    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "চ) $A$ ও $B$ যেকোনো সেট হলে, $A \\cap B \\subseteq A$ এবং $A \\cap B \\subseteq B$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
