    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রমাণ:** কেবল দুইটি প্রতিজ্বার প্রমাণ দেওয়া হয়েছে। অন্যগুলো নিজে করো।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
      "pdfPageEnd": 15,
      "printedPageStart": 10,
      "printedPageEnd": 10,
      "reviewReasons": [],
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p009",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ঘ) দেওয়া আছে, $A \\subseteq \\emptyset$, আবার আমরা জানি, $\\emptyset \\subseteq A$। সুতরাং $A = \\emptyset$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A \\subseteq \\emptyset",
        "\\emptyset \\subseteq A",
        "A = \\emptyset"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
      "pdfPageEnd": 15,
      "printedPageStart": 10,
      "printedPageEnd": 10,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ছ) সেট সংযোগের সংজ্ঞানুযায়ী, $A$ সেটের সকল উপাদান $A \\cup B$ সেটে থাকে। সুতরাং উপসেটের সংজ্ঞানুযায়ী $A \\subseteq A \\cup B$। একই যুক্তিতে $B \\subseteq A \\cup B$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A",
        "A \\cup B",
        "A \\subseteq A \\cup B",
        "B \\subseteq A \\cup B"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
      "pdfPageEnd": 15,
      "printedPageStart": 10,
      "printedPageEnd": 10,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p011",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**কাজ:** নিচের সকল সেট সার্বিক সেট $U$ এর উপসেট বিবেচনা করতে হবে।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "U"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
      "pdfPageEnd": 15,
      "printedPageStart": 10,
      "printedPageEnd": 10,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p012",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ক) দেখাও যে, $A \\cap (B \\cap C) = (A \\cap B) \\cap (A \\cap C)$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A \\cap (B \\cap C) = (A \\cap B) \\cap (A \\cap C)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
      "pdfPageEnd": 15,
      "printedPageStart": 10,
      "printedPageEnd": 10,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p013",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "খ) দেখাও যে, $A \\subset B$ হবে যদি এবং কেবল যদি নিম্নোক্ত যেকোনো একটি শর্ত থাকে:\n(১) $A \\cap B = A$\n(২) $A \\cup B = B$\n(৩) $B' \\subset A'$\n(৪) $A \\cap B' = \\emptyset$\n(৫) $B \\cup A' = U$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A \\subset B",
        "A \\cap B = A",
        "A \\cup B = B",
        "B' \\subset A'",
        "A \\cap B' = \\emptyset",
        "B \\cup A' = U"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
      "pdfPageEnd": 15,
      "printedPageStart": 10,
      "printedPageEnd": 10,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p014",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "গ) দেখাও যে,\n(১) $A \\setminus B \\subset A \\cup B$\n(২) $A' \\setminus B' = B \\setminus A$\n(৩) $A \\setminus B \\subset A$\n(৪) $A \\subset B$ হলে, $A \\cup (B \\setminus A) = B$\n(৫) $A \\cap B = \\emptyset$ হলে, $A \\subset B'$ এবং $A \\cap B' = A$ এবং $A \\cup B' = B'$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A \\setminus B \\subset A \\cup B",
        "A' \\setminus B' = B \\setminus A",
        "A \\setminus B \\subset A",
        "A \\subset B",
        "A \\cup (B \\setminus A) = B",
        "A \\cap B = \\emptyset",
        "A \\subset B'",
        "A \\cap B' = A",
        "A \\cup B' = B'"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
      "pdfPageEnd": 15,
      "printedPageStart": 10,
      "printedPageEnd": 10,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.19-p015",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ঘ) দেখাও যে,\n(১) $(A \\cap B)' = A' \\cup B'$\n(২) $(A \\cup B \\cup C)' = A' \\cap B' \\cap C'$\n(৩) $(A \\cap B \\cap C)' = A' \\cup B' \\cup C'$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(A \\cap B)' = A' \\cup B'",
        "(A \\cup B \\cup C)' = A' \\cap B' \\cap C'",
        "(A \\cap B \\cap C)' = A' \\cup B' \\cup C'"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 15,
